{
  "_id": "tg-exalt",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "my father’s God, and I will exalt him, Ex. 15:2. exalt the horn of his anointed, 1 Sam. 2:10. exalted be the God of the rock, 2 Sam. 22:47 (Ps. 18:46). Lord, and thou art exalted as head above all, 1 Chr. 29:11. God exalteth by his power, Job 36:22. thou art exalted far above all gods, Ps. 97:9. By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted, Prov. 11:11. Righteousness exalteth a nation, Prov. 14:34. he that exalteth his gate seeketh destruction, Prov. 17:19. shall be exalted above the hills, Isa. 2:2 (Micah 4:1; 2 Ne. 12:2). Lord alone shall be exalted in that day, Isa. 2:11. I will exalt my throne above the stars of God, Isa. 14:13 (2 Ne. 24:13). Every valley shall be exalted, Isa. 40:4. exalt him that is low, Ezek. 21:26.",
