    {
      "text": "Capernaum, which art exalted, Matt. 11:23 (Luke 10:15). exalt himself shall be abased, Matt. 23:12 (Luke 14:11; 18:14; D&C 101:42; 112:3; 124:114). exalted them of low degree, Luke 1:52. by the right hand of God exalted, Acts 2:33. Him hath God exalted with his right hand, Acts 5:31. if a man exalt himself, 2 Cor. 11:20. lest I should be exalted above measure, 2 Cor. 12:7. God also hath highly exalted him, Philip. 2:9. exalteth himself above all that is called God, 2 Thes. 2:4. low degree rejoice in that he is exalted, James 1:9. that he may exalt you in due time, 1 Pet. 5:6.",
